<p style="margin:0 0 20px;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7">*Bundled pricing includes three years of comprehensive service and support.</p>
<div style="margin-bottom:36px;padding:24px 30px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--surface-blue)">
<strong style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--navy);font-size:17px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.02em">Why prices vary within each tier</strong>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">Liberty Hearing Center partners with seven leading hearing aid manufacturers, giving you access to a wide range of trusted technology. Because manufacturer costs differ, prices within each tier reflect the specific brand and device that best fits your hearing needs, lifestyle, and budget. During your consultation, we'll help you find the right option — and the right price point — within your tier.</p>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px">
<article style="padding:28px 30px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-top:4px solid var(--gold);border-radius:14px;background:var(--white);transition:.3s" style-hover="box-shadow:0 18px 45px rgba(var(--navy-rgb),.11)">
<h3 style="margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--navy);font-size:22px;font-weight:750;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.025em">Premium Hearing Aid</h3>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--gold);font-size:15px;font-weight:750">$3,970–$4,650 unbundled / $6,670–$7,350 bundled</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">The top technology level from each manufacturer we carry. Built for the hardest listening situations there are: a crowded restaurant, a room full of overlapping conversation, a reverberant church or auditorium. These devices carry the most advanced speech-in-noise processing, automatic directionality, and connectivity features available, and they make the most decisions on your behalf as your environment changes.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">The right choice for patients whose daily life regularly puts them in noise they cannot control.</p>
</article>
<article style="padding:28px 30px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-top:4px solid var(--gold);border-radius:14px;background:var(--white);transition:.3s" style-hover="box-shadow:0 18px 45px rgba(var(--navy-rgb),.11)">
<h3 style="margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--navy);font-size:22px;font-weight:750;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.025em">Active Lifestyle</h3>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--gold);font-size:15px;font-weight:750">$3,100–$3,500 unbundled / $5,800–$6,200 bundled</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">Strong performance in noise and full wireless connectivity, for patients who are out in the world consistently — work meetings, restaurants, group activities, travel, worship services. The processing handles demanding environments well, with fewer of the automatic refinements that the premium level applies in the most complex settings.</p>
</article>
<article style="padding:28px 30px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-top:4px solid var(--gold);border-radius:14px;background:var(--white);transition:.3s" style-hover="box-shadow:0 18px 45px rgba(var(--navy-rgb),.11)">
<h3 style="margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--navy);font-size:22px;font-weight:750;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.025em">Casual Listener</h3>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--gold);font-size:15px;font-weight:750">$2,660–$2,800 unbundled / $5,360–$5,500 bundled</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">Suited to environments that are largely predictable: home, television, one-on-one and small-group conversation, quieter social settings. Background noise is managed capably without the processing power built for a packed restaurant.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">A sound fit for patients whose listening demands are steady and whose difficult situations are occasional rather than daily.</p>
</article>
<article style="padding:28px 30px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-top:4px solid var(--gold);border-radius:14px;background:var(--white);transition:.3s" style-hover="box-shadow:0 18px 45px rgba(var(--navy-rgb),.11)">
<h3 style="margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--navy);font-size:22px;font-weight:750;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.025em">Essential Listening</h3>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--gold);font-size:15px;font-weight:750">$2,000 unbundled / $4,950 bundled</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">Entry-level amplification covering the fundamentals: clear speech in quiet, conversation with one person, television at a reasonable volume. It is a genuine hearing aid fitted and verified to the same clinical standard as every other tier, at the lowest price point we can offer.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">The starting point for patients working within a tight budget or with straightforward listening needs, and a real improvement over untreated hearing loss.</p>
</article>
