<strong style="display:block;margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--navy);font-size:17px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.01em">Bundled vs. unbundled</strong>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;text-wrap:pretty">Bundled plans fold three years of hearing aid services into the price of the devices. Unbundled pricing lowers the up-front cost and charges for each visit as you use it.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;text-wrap:pretty">Both options are fitted and verified to the same clinical standard.</p>
